<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Anxiety Alchemy: 50 Powerful Affirmations</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #1E3A5F;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F8F8F6 0%, #E8E8E6 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            padding: 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A5F 0%, #2A4A75 100%);
            border-radius: 20px;
            color: #F8F8F6;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            right: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(184, 115, 51, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg); }
            33% { transform: translate(30px, -30px) rotate(120deg); }
            66% { transform: translate(-20px, 20px) rotate(240deg); }
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 3.2em;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.3em;
            font-weight: 300;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #A8B5A0;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .header .tagline {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            color: #B87333;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 35px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(30, 58, 95, 0.1);
            border-left: 5px solid #B87333;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .section:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(30, 58, 95, 0.15);
        }
        
        .section::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            right: 0;
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 181, 160, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.8em;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1E3A5F;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #A8B5A0;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .affirmation {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F8F8F6 0%, rgba(168, 181, 160, 0.1) 100%);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 3px solid #B87333;
            font-weight: 400;
            font-size: 1.05em;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .affirmation:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(184, 115, 51, 0.1) 0%, rgba(168, 181, 160, 0.2) 100%);
            transform: translateX(10px);
        }
        
        .affirmation::before {
            content: '"';
            font-size: 2em;
            color: #B87333;
            position: absolute;
            left: -5px;
            top: -5px;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }
        
        .affirmation::after {
            content: '"';
            font-size: 2em;
            color: #B87333;
            position: absolute;
            right: 10px;
            bottom: -15px;
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }
        
        .cta-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #A8B5A0 0%, #9AA88C 100%);
            border-radius: 20px;
            color: #1E3A5F;
            margin: 60px 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .cta-section::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(184, 115, 51, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.7; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 0.3; }
        }
        
        .cta-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 2.2em;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .cta-text {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #B87333 0%, #D4A574 100%);
            color: #F8F8F6;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(184, 115, 51, 0.3);
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(184, 115, 51, 0.4);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A574 0%, #B87333 100%);
        }
        
        .personal-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(30, 58, 95, 0.05) 0%, rgba(168, 181, 160, 0.05) 100%);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin: 40px 0;
            border: 2px dashed #A8B5A0;
        }
        
        .personal-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 1.6em;
            color: #1E3A5F;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .input-line {
            border: none;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #A8B5A0;
            background: transparent;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px 0;
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            color: #1E3A5F;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .input-line:focus {
            border-bottom-color: #B87333;
        }
        
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #1E3A5F;
            color: #F8F8F6;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
        
        .credentials {
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #A8B5A0;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        
        .decorative-element {
            width: 60px;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #B87333 0%, #A8B5A0 100%);
            margin: 20px auto;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container { padding: 20px 15px; }
            .header h1 { font-size: 2.5em; }
            .section { padding: 25px; }
            .section-title { font-size: 1.5em; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>ANXIETY ALCHEMY</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">50 Powerful Affirmations for High-Achieving Professional Women</div>
            <div class="tagline">Transform your inner dialogue from anxious to empowered</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When anxiety hits during important meetings...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">I trust my expertise - I'm here because I belong here.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">My worth isn't determined by one meeting outcome.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I can feel anxious AND still show up powerfully.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">My nervous system is trying to protect me, but I'm actually safe.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I choose to breathe deeply and let my competence shine through.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When perfectionism is paralyzing you...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">Progress over perfection gets me to my goals faster.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">My 80% is still exceptional by most standards.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I release the need to control every outcome.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">Done is better than perfect, and I execute brilliantly.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I give myself permission to be human while achieving greatness.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When overwhelm threatens to derail your day...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">I don't have to do everything today - just the next right thing.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">Overwhelm is information, not a life sentence.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I'm going to prioritize ruthlessly and delegate fearlessly.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">My plate is full because I'm trusted with important work.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I create calm in the storm by focusing on what I can control.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When imposter syndrome whispers lies...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">I didn't luck into this position - I earned it through skill and dedication.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">Everyone feels like they're figuring it out as they go.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">My unique perspective is exactly what this situation needs.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I belong in rooms where decisions are made.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I'm not pretending to be qualified - I AM qualified.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When setting boundaries feels impossible...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">Saying no to this means saying yes to my wellbeing.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I can be helpful without being available 24/7.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">My boundaries protect my ability to show up fully.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I teach people how to treat me by how I treat myself.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">Strong leaders know when to step back and recharge.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When your body is screaming anxiety signals...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">These sensations are temporary - they will pass.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">My heart is racing because my system thinks I'm in danger, but I'm safe.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I'm going to breathe into my belly and remind my nervous system we're okay.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">This physical response doesn't define my capability.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I acknowledge this feeling without letting it drive my decisions.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When decision-making feels paralyzing...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">I have access to all the information I need to make good decisions.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I trust my intuition - it's guided me this far successfully.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">There's no perfect choice, only the next aligned step.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I can pivot and adjust as new information emerges.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">My track record proves I make sound decisions under pressure.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When burnout is knocking at your door...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">Rest is productive - it's how I sustain excellence.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I give myself permission to slow down without guilt.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">Taking care of myself IS taking care of business.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I can be ambitious and kind to myself simultaneously.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">Recovery isn't weakness - it's strategic self-management.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When comparing yourself to other successful women...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">Her success doesn't diminish my own possibilities.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I celebrate other women's wins because abundance is available to all of us.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I'm exactly where I need to be on my unique journey.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">Comparison steals my joy and my focus - I'm redirecting both back to my goals.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I choose collaboration over competition every time.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">When anxiety tells you that you can't handle what's coming...</h3>
            <div class="affirmation">I've handled 100% of my difficult days so far.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I have tools, resources, and resilience I haven't even tapped into yet.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">Anxiety lies about my capabilities - I know my truth.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I've overcome challenges before that seemed impossible at the time.</div>
            <div class="affirmation">I'm building my confidence muscle with every brave action I take.</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="personal-section">
            <h3 class="personal-title">Your Turn...</h3>
            <p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; color: #1E3A5F;">What are YOUR most powerful anxiety-alchemizing affirmations?</p>
            <div class="decorative-element"></div>
            <input type="text" class="input-line" placeholder="Write your personal affirmation here...">
            <input type="text" class="input-line" placeholder="Write your personal affirmation here...">
            <input type="text" class="input-line" placeholder="Write your personal affirmation here...">
            <input type="text" class="input-line" placeholder="Write your personal affirmation here...">
            <input type="text" class="input-line" placeholder="Write your personal affirmation here...">
        </div>
        
        <div class="cta-section">
            <h3 class="cta-title">Ready to transform anxiety into your superpower?</h3>
            <p class="cta-text">These affirmations are just the beginning. In Anxiety Alchemy Academy, we dive deeper into rewiring your nervous system, mastering your mindset, and creating sustainable success without the burnout.</p>
            <div class="decorative-element"></div>
            <p style="font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 25px; position: relative; z-index: 2;">Join other high-achieving women who are done letting anxiety run their lives.</p>
            <a href="#" class="cta-button">Learn More About Anxiety Alchemy Academy</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p style="font-size: 1.1em; margin-bottom: 10px;">Transform your relationship with anxiety and step into your most powerful self.</p>
            <div class="decorative-element"></div>
            <div class="credentials">
                Clinical Hypnotherapist | Master Practitioner of NLP | Reiki Energy Worker | Claircognizant
                <br>Creator of The Ascension System
            </div>
